    "intro_narrative": "The rain beats relentlessly against the cracked windows of an abandoned precinct. You are a private investigator, hired to uncover the truth behind a cold case that has haunted the city for decades. Your client went missing last week, leaving behind nothing but an address and a cryptic warning: 'Trust the trail of evidence, not the people.' Stepping into the dimly lit office, the smell of damp paper and ozone lingers in the air. The room is a chaotic web of connected devices, locked containers, and forgotten notes. Whoever was here before you was close to an answer, meticulously piecing together fragments of a digital puzzle. Your objective is clear: navigate this maze of archaic technology and hidden clues to access the master database. To do this, you must logically trace the flow of information, using the right tools at the right time. Every machine and artifact in this room is connected. Follow the data, decode the mystery, and find out what really happened before the culprits return to silence you once and for all.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
